<title>FINLAND: FINNISH AUGUST INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION RISES 1.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH AUGUST INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION RISES 1.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production</p>
<p>growth adjusted for working days slowed to 1.8 percent</p>
<p>year-on-year in August from 5.2 percent (revised from 5.0)</p>
<p>percent in July, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Tuesday in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>		   Aug 1996   July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p>		   +1.8 pct     +5.2 pct    +7.9 pct</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of</p>
<p>4.8 percent (range +3.0 - +6.5 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
